/P 504 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Gene Gifford, who established the Adam Visser Memorial Scholarship Fund of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County in honor of Adam Visser a former Jayhawk all-conference player and a member of the 1990 national runner-up squad. Adam battled ALS \(Lou Gehrig's Disease\) for three years and passed away on February 16, 2007. "Adam was a tremendous competitor," said Gene Gifford, who coached him at MCC. He was a great person and a tremendous father and husband who courageously fought the battle against ALS.)
