/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Peter Turner, who established the Beverley Turner Memorial Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Beverley Turner moved to Muskegon from Canada in 1972 and shortly thereafter became an instructor at Muskegon Community College. This has been established in memory of Beverley by her husband, Peter Turner. The grant scholarship awards to graduates of Muskegon Community College who wish to continue their education. This and its purpose reflect Beverley Turner's lifelong interest in and dedication to excellence in education. To the credit of Mr. Turner and his generosity, Beverley Turner continues to inspire academic excellence in the Muskegon youth through the lasting gift of education.)
/Pg 11 0 R
