/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of the family of Bill Boyden, who established the Bill Boyden Rotary - YFCA Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Bill Boyden owned Boyden Electric for 30 years and served as President of the YFCA and Rotary Boards of Directors. He showed a strong interest in promoting youth's leadership abilities, and when he died in 1980, his family established this award to recognize them. Accordingly, this award goes to a deserving individual who displays the leadership qualities Bill valued so highly. Through this, Bill Boyden will continue to promote leadership among young people in Muskegon. )
