/P 507 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Walter E. Busker, who established the Busker Family Fund of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Walter Busker was a long-time Muskegon resident and a member of the First Congregational Church. He joined Campbell, Wyant, and Cannon in 1951 as Chief Financial Officer. He served in several positions until his retirement in 1976. As their four children grew up, the Buskers continually emphasized the importance of education. The Busker Family Fund mirrors these values, as one-third of the income from the Fund provides scholarships for young people in the Muskegon area. Through the creation of the Busker Family Fund, Walter Busker's emphasis on education has grown into a lasting reality, granting the permanent gift of education to the youth of his community.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
