/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of the William Busker family, who established the Busker Family Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. This is a competitive scholarship for the study of science, technology, engineering, math, teaching, nursing, accounting, or a trade or vocational skills. You have been chosen because we believe that you have the ability and are motivated to reach your potential. The Busker family believes that by completing your education, you will be able to improve your own economic well-being, as well as the well-being of your community. They also believe that giving back should begin early and become a lifelong habit. It is their hope that, as you benefit from your education, you will help other students like you by giving back through gifts to the Community Foundation for Muskegon County and to this scholarship fund. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
