/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Dennis & Susan Emmons, who established the Dennis L. and Susan K. Emmons Instrumental Music Scholarship. A graduate of Muskegon High School and Michigan State University, Dennis taught at Grant Public Schools from 1965 to 1967 before returning to Muskegon. He was a band Director at Nelson Junior High from 1967-1970, and was named band director at North Muskegon Public Schools in the fall of 1970. Dennis returned to Muskegon in the fall of 1986, serving as director at Bunker Middle School and assisting at Muskegon High School until his retirement in 1994. This scholarship supports band students at North Muskegon High School, Muskegon High School, and Reeths-Puffer High School.)
