/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Dr. J. Max and Elizabeth Busard, who established the Dr. J. Max and Elizabeth Busard Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Following a distinguished medical career spanning decades, Dr. Max Busard and his wife made a commitment to support students pursuing a medical degree at the University of Michigan Medical School, Dr. Busard's alma mater. The Dr. J. Max and Elizabeth Busard Scholarship will be available to Muskegon and Ottawa counties residents who have graduated from any post-secondary institution and are attending the U of M Medical School. Dr. Busard worked at Hackley Hospital from 1949 to 1989 and was the medical director of Hospice of Muskegon-Oceana for 14 years. )
