/P 511 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Edith Neff Swanson, who established the Edith Neff Swanson Memorial Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. To say that Edith Neff Swanson had a passion for art does not begin to tell the story. Though Edith resided in the Southwest, she spent summers on Lake Michigan, leaving behind a fabulous collection of beautiful watercolor art. Edith received a B.A. in Art Education but remained an "art student" in the finest sense of the term throughout her life, always striving to master new techniques and hone her craft. This Scholarship Fund will help aspiring young artists pursue art as their life's passion.)
