/P 511 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Edward F. Wingler, who established the Edward F. Wingler and Peggy F. Wingler Pink Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Ed was a 1958 graduate of Muskegon High School and, before his retirement, had been a high school English and theater teacher in Tennessee and Hinsdale, Illinois, for 40 years. Ed passed away in November 2013 and, through his trust, had designated the Community Foundation for Muskegon County as a beneficiary. Ed never forgot his Muskegon roots; now, his legacy will live on through this scholarship.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
