/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Michael Farmer, who established the Elizabeth Ann Farmer Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. With his mother, Patricia Farmer, he created this scholarship in memory of his sister, Liz. A graduate of Hope College and a devoted educator, she had a passion for teaching and a commitment to young learners, leaving a lasting impact on her students. Her kind spirit, dedication to teaching, love of photography, and affection for dogs inspired many. This scholarship will continue her legacy of caring and investing in education.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
