/P 512 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Joan Grillo, who established the Emma Mowers Grillo Sholten Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Emma's father, a founding member of this community, passed on his love for the Muskegon region to his youngest daughter. She worked tirelessly on behalf of many civic organizations, especially the Veterans, honoring the memory of her father, who served in the Civil War. This legacy of service has been passed down first to her children and now to her grandchildren, who have established it so that her legacy will continue to support the community she so dearly loved. They chose the Community Foundation to manage this because of its outstanding reputation for supporting the residents of the Muskegon area.)
