/P 513 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Ernest D. Moylan, who established the Ernest D. Moylan Scholarship of the Muskegon County Community Foundation. Ernest Moylan, a lifelong Muskegon resident, had interests in, among other matters, a Texas oil concern. This particular oil interest became highly profitable, leaving Mr. Moylan with more money than he needed. Perfectly content to live on his pension, Mr. Moylan decided to donate the oil interest proceeds to the Community Foundation and establish the Moylan Scholarship. This scholarship grants one of the Community Foundation's most prestigious awards and is given based on academic excellence. To the credit of Ernest Moylan and his true generosity, countless Muskegon students will be rewarded with the lasting gift of education.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
