/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Eugene W. and Joanne M. Hosko, who established the Eugene W. and Joanne M. Hosko Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Gene and Joanne have lived in Muskegon most of their lives. Both have degrees in elementary education and taught primarily at Reeths-Puffer Schools. As educators, they have worked with many children who could benefit from the chance to further their education and contribute to society. They have chosen to create this scholarship to support this endeavor because they have seen the many ways the Community Foundation has contributed to the growth of Muskegon County.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
