/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Hilma VanEerden, who established the August VanEerden Scholarship of the Foundation for Muskegon Community College of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County in memory of August VanEerden. August VanEerden was, for many years, a teacher and business manager in the Muskegon and St. Joseph, Michigan public school systems. Mr. VanEerden was the Business Manager at Muskegon Community College from 1965 until he died in 1971. This scholarship is to assist a Muskegon High School graduate with a grade point average of at least 2.7 who is enrolling as a regular degree-seeking student who plans on a career in the field of education.)
