/P 516 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of George E. Dake, who established the George E. Dake Scholarship Fund of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Ned, as he was known to friends, was a long-time resident of the White Lake area. He was a proud 83-year member of the Boy Scouts of America and an avid sailor who loved to travel. An engineer/contractor by trade, Ned left a gift through his estate to create this scholarship to support students from Muskegon or Whitehall High Schools pursuing technical or vocational training.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
