778 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 517 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of the family and friends of Henrik Olving, who have created the Henrik Olving Memorial For The Gifted Scholarship of the Muskegon County Community Foundation. Henrik Olving, an only child, died in a tragic accident in his early twenties. His parents and friends established the Henrik Olving Memorial in his memory because, in their words, "Henrik was a creative, sensitive, talented person. Naturally, we, his parents, feel the loss of him acutely. Henrik died, but there are and will be many others like him. Mankind needs every one of them for enlightenment and survival on this planet. Thus, we suggested that people who wanted to remember him do so with a memorial to benefit the gifted." To the credit of Henrik Olving's parents and friends, his inspiring and creative spirit will endure forever through the lasting gift of education.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
