<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 517 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Henry and Ethelyn Hansen, who established the Henry and Ethelyn Hansen Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Henry Hansen, whose Norwegian parents immigrated to Muskegon during the lumbering era, was a self-taught man and a voracious reader who never stopped learning. Henry and his wife Ethelyn, long-time members of Samuel Lutheran Church, had no children and wanted to help young people achieve their dreams of higher education. Accordingly, awards from the Hansen Scholarship are given to worthy students who are members of Harbor of Grace Lutheran Church. Through this fund, the Hansens continue to grant the lasting gift of education to Muskegon students.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
