/P 517 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Todd Herremans, who established the Herremans Scholar-Athlete Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Todd Herremans, a Division II All-American, All-Star, and Ravenna High School graduate, had a successful career with the Philadelphia Eagles of the National Football League from 2005 to 2014. Even though he lived out of state for many years, he never forgot about his home. He established this scholarship fund to honor the scholar-athlete at Ravenna High School.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
