/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Jack Schimke, who established the Jack Schimke Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Jack Schimke, an area business owner and friend of the community, embodied the idea that everyone has something to give back. Jack was a well-known and well-liked butcher, a longtime employee of Eberhard Foods and, later, a co-owner of Butcher Boy of North Muskegon. Jack Schimke's contagious good nature and smile behind the counter will live on through his generosity to his community. The Jack Schimke will be used for scholarships for vocational and other training at an accredited institution.)
/Pg 23 0 R
