/P 518 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Elfrieda E. Murphy, who established the James A. and Elfrieda E. Murphy Memorial Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County in memory of her husband, James A. Murphy. Jim Murphy was a lifelong Muskegon resident who worked for 32 years at Continental Motors. He was an avid golfer, an Old Newsboy, an active social member of the Muskegon Elks and Eagles, a world traveler with his wife, Elfrieda, and a friend to many people who were very important to him. He was also a long-time member of Our Savior's Lutheran Church. Mrs. Murphy established this in his memory to assist members of Our Savior's Lutheran Church to attend post-secondary educational institutions. Through the James A. Murphy Memorial, Jim Murphy's zest for life will always be remembered.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [14]
>>
