/P 519 0 R
/E (This scholarship is made possible by a gift from Janice Agard through her will. Jan was a long-time educator, teaching both high school and at Muskegon Community College. She loved animals and also provided a gift to support animal needs in Muskegon County. Jan created this scholarship in honor of her mother, Norma, who faced financial challenges when she returned to school after her husband died. This fund will enable students aged 30+ to pursue their goals at MCC while covering their full educational expenses.)
