/P 519 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of the family and friends of Jared E. Collinge, who established the Jared E. Collinge Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Jerry Collinge was a long-time and well-known Muskegon lawyer who practiced until shortly before his death. He was very proud that all of the Collinge family members graduated from Muskegon Community College. During Jerry's last days, he and his wife, Marge, discussed establishing a scholarship fund. He wanted to support students who would attend his favorite colleges and alma mater, Muskegon Community College and U of M. Marge would often call Pat Johnson at the Community Foundation to discuss Jerry's wishes, also conferring with their son and daughters. Finally, Jerry was very pleased to learn that his wishes would be honored and that a fund would be established in his name.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [14]
>>
