/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Jamall S. Johnson, who established the Johnson Family - Grambling State University Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. When Jamall Johnson received a scholarship from the Moses J. The Jones Scholarship Fund at the Community Foundation did more than lead Mr. Johnson to graduate with honors from his beloved Grambling State University; it planted in Jamall a desire to assist other young African Americans in pursuing a college education at Grambling State. Now a successful professional healthcare representative for Pfizer, Inc., Johnson and his wife, Ginger, donated Pfizer stock to create their scholarship fund.)
