/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Montague High School Alumni, who established the Montague High School Alumni Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. The Montague High School Alumni and Community Scholarship Foundation was created in May 2007. The Community Foundation hopes to provide scholarships for graduating MHS students so that more of them can pursue post-secondary education. Ultimately, the goal is to generate enough funds to cover the tuition for all MHS graduates as they pursue post-secondary education for up to 4 years. Considering the rising tuition costs and the number of families struggling to make ends meet, the MHS Alumni and Community Scholarship Foundation will make it possible for many who might otherwise never have the opportunity to further their education.)
