/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Nan Riekse, who established the Nan Riekse Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Nan Riekse has a lofty dream: to inspire. By establishing the Nan Riekse Scholarship and the Nan Riekse Donor Advised Funds, she has taken an important step toward realizing her dream. Her Scholarship will support non-traditional students attending Muskegon Community College with financial needs. Her scholarships will target adult women attending school after raising their children or rebuilding their lives following a divorce. The Donor Advised Fund will benefit local churches and a senior care center. Nan is an outstanding example of the "Power of One.")
