/E (This scholarship was made possible by the generosity of Jill Sanders, who established the Neil J. Sanders Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County in honor of her husband, Neil. A lover of the outdoors, Neil Sanders enjoyed hiking and backpacking with his sons and friends. He was interested in all kinds of sports and activities, reading mysteries and thrillers, mountain climbing, and teaching yoga. Thirty-three years of his life were devoted to counseling students at Muskegon Community College. So, his wife, Jill, memorialized his name forever with a scholarship fund. As you may expect, the fund will support students who plan to attend MCC.)
