/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of George and Mary Ann Byam, son and daughter-in-law of Oliver and Mildred Byam, who established the Oliver and Mildred Byam Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. The Oliver and Mildred Byam Scholarship benefits the recipient of the annual Oliver R. Byam Sports Award and the Geraldine Beausang Sports Award at Whitehall High School. The award was established in the 1960s and is given to the senior boy and girl who best exemplify Oliver Byam's ideals and standards in his sports participation and attitude. The Byams both formerly worked for the Whitehall school district, Mildred as a kindergarten teacher, and Oliver as a high school teacher and basketball and track coach.)
