/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of many people in the Ravenna Community, who established the Ravenna Community Educational Foundation Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Dolores E. \(Dee\) Swanson gave the initial gift to start this in December 2006. At that time, it was a Build A Fund, but a gift from Rudolph and Ruth Lonnee put it over the top late in 2007. The Ravenna Community Educational Foundation intends to use it to enhance the quality of education by providing educational opportunities, generating and distributing financial and other resources to benefit the students and staff of the Ravenna Community Schools.)
