/P 534 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Lori Goryl, who established the Reading is the Key Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. After several years of teaching, Lori Goryl found her professional home in the Title 1 program, where small-group teaching helps students who need an extra boost. Her Adopt-A-Reader Program at Reeths-Puffer McMillan Elementary has been pairing up reading volunteers with elementary students for 13 years. Lori has since retired but still wants to continue encouraging children to pursue higher educational goals. She established this scholarship fund for McMillan Elementary students to help with college expenses.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
