/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Irene Damm, who established the Rolland and Irene Damm Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Rolland Damm was a member of a historically prominent Muskegon family and the owner of Damm Hardware, a landmark in the Muskegon community for many generations. He strongly supported Muskegon Community College, chairing millage elections and serving on its Board. Because of the Depression, Irene was not able to attend college. Upon her husband's death, she established the Rolland and Irene Damm Scholarship to ensure that students realize their college education dreams.)
