/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Neal Barber, who established the Sharon Barber Memorial Scholarship in memory of Sharon. Sharon was a special Orchard View teacher for 35 years. Known for her warmth and wonderful smile, Mrs. Barber touched the lives of hundreds of children. So many former students have mentioned her positive outlook as their motivation to persevere in their own lives. Mrs. Barber received the 2003 "My Cool Teacher" award from WZZM-TV for her dedication. Sharon died in April 2004. Her husband, Neal, created this fund to award scholarships to Orchard View graduating seniors.)
