/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Sally Weersing and her family, who established the Spencer Weersing Memorial Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Spencer Weersing was a respected dentist and citizen of Montague, an avid sailor, a world traveler, and a beloved friend of the entire community. He was an inspiration to everyone whose life he touched. With memorials received in his memory, Dr. Weersing's family has established this scholarship to memorialize his devotion to life and to pass on his exemplary community spirit. The Spencer Weersing Memorial Scholarship will help Muskegon County high school graduates attend the University of Michigan, beginning a legacy in Dr. Weersing's name that grows in the hearts and minds of the community he so loved and supported.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
