/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of the family of Tomasa Ramirez Ybarra, who established the Tomasa Ramirez Ybarra Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. This scholarship was created to recognize a woman who has been an active advocate for the Latino community for years. Tomasa made a difference in the community through her dedication to her family, nurturing her heritage through her children, creating change, recognizing those who were unrecognized or forgotten, and understanding the differences we all have. She lived her life as a giver and nurturer, giving back to her community.)
