/P 540 0 R
/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of William & Beverly, who established the William W. & Beverly I. Sutton Fund of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Bill and Beverly visited with us in 2014 and shared their plans to leave a gift from their trust. After Bill's passing in 2018, this designated fund was created per their wishes to support Crestwood United Methodist Church, the American Red Cross, Every Woman's Place, Mission for Area People, and a scholarship for Orchard View students. Bill and Beverly's legacy of caring will live on...forever.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [14]
