/E (This scholarship has been made possible by the generosity of Tom and Jill Zeller, who established the Zeller Family Scholarship of the Community Foundation for Muskegon County. Tom and Jill Zeller have always appreciated their education from Fruitport Community Schools. Both of their children are also Fruitport grads, and Tom and Jill felt that it was their time to give back to the schools that gave them so much. They have established a scholarship fund that will benefit fellow Fruitport graduates in the future.)
